  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Detroit Rain Catchment &amp; Produce Washing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We partner with urban farms to provide water solutions to aid in agricultural growth, community development, and resource management. We&apos;re building a water catchment system for irrigation and produce washing for Nurturing Our Seeds, a nonprofit farm in Detroit. The wash station will be a shared space for a local Black farmer collective to wash and pack their produce to more effectively provide food to their communities. This project will support this amazing local partner in more ways than one!</narrative>
  </description>
